# 基本文章編集の文字サイズと用紙枠のメニュー: the desktop's own and the process write the same
# record and show the same page (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py. Two copies of 基本文章編集
# with 30 paragraphs (mkbig doc 30): letters of the second paragraph picked by carrying the
# hand across them, then 文字サイズ > 21（1.5倍） and 書式 > 用紙枠表示オンオフ chosen from the
# menu opened at 300,250, and saved. Record 0 of both must be the same, byte for byte; the
# shots (doc_size_k_*, doc_size_p_*) are compared afterwards inside the window, where the text
# is (101,125 to 682,482).
# The menu opens with the item chosen last on the pointer's row, its rows 20 apart (閉じる,
# a line, 保存, 表示, 編集, 書体, 文字修飾, 文字サイズ 140 below 閉じる, 文字色, 書式 180
# below); a menu beside it opens with its first row on the row it hangs from (21（1.5倍） 200
# below; 用紙枠表示オンオフ 280 below). The desktop's first menu has nothing chosen before it;
# the process's first one has 書式, chosen last by the desktop's. While the desktop's menu is
# open the desktop answers no sync: it is waited for instead.
# Keys: Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
docproc kernel
mkbig doc 30
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 500
drag 160 170 420 170
sync 600
click 300 250 1
wait 400
move 330 390
wait 300
move 440 390
wait 400
move 440 590
wait 300
click 440 590
sync 600
wait 300
move 690 490
sync 600
shot doc_size_k_size
click 300 250 1
wait 400
move 330 290
wait 300
move 440 290
wait 400
move 440 570
wait 300
click 440 570
sync 600
wait 300
move 690 490
sync 600
shot doc_size_k_frame
key 16 01
sync 600
sum show
keep kernel
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig doc 30
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 30
wait 800
logmark
drag 160 170 420 170
expectsince document: drew
logmark
click 300 250 1
expectsince document: menu
wait 400
move 330 210
wait 300
move 440 210
wait 400
move 440 410
wait 300
click 440 410
expectsince document: command size
expectsince document: drew
wait 300
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_size_p_size
logmark
click 300 250 1
expectsince document: menu
wait 400
move 330 290
wait 300
move 440 290
wait 400
move 440 570
wait 300
click 440 570
expectsince document: command paperframe
expectsince document: drew
wait 300
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_size_p_frame
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince document: saved (0)
sum show
same kernel
key 08 01
expect document: closed
